claim.claim-text:
a liquid reservoir structure (2) comprising a liquid chamber (21) adapted to receive a liquid to be atomized, the liquid chamber (21) comprising a bottom plate (25) having an upper surface (25a);
an elastic member (8), wherein the upper surface (25a) of the bottom plate (25) comprises a recess (25b) for receiving the elastic member (8);
a means of ultrasonic vibrations (5) supported by the elastic member (8);
a sonication chamber (22) in fluid communication with the liquid chamber (21), the sonication chamber (22) comprising the means of ultrasonic vibrations (5); and
a capillary element (7) arranged between the liquid chamber (21) and the sonication chamber (22), the capillary element (7) comprising a central portion (7a) and a peripheral portion (7b), the peripheral portion (7b) having an L-shape cross section extending down to the liquid chamber (21), and the central portion (7a) having a U-shape cross section extending down to the sonication chamber (22).
